{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>ולא נתתי</b> Two times. One is this. And the other: ולא נתתי לחטוא (Joshua). This is what they expounded in Sifrei: I did not forget to mention Your name upon it and to bless You. Meaning: I did not sin with it through my speech." "<b>למת</b> Two times. One is this. And the other: על תבכו למת ואל תנודו לו (Jeremiah). That is: I did not give of it for the needs of the dead — neither for eulogies nor for lamentations."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:10:45.394167857Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}